{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Exer Gale is a virtual reality arcade game for those who wish to fly and get away. The game gives you the freedom to glide, dive and climb in charming tropical environments using your body. Fly at your own pace for leisure or master the levels and race against time. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock new maps, set new high scores, and enjoy the aerial playground of Exer Gale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive, glide and soar to get the best score </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078200/extras/diving.gif?t=1749797420\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flap your hands and fly free. Zero buttons involved!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078200/extras/flapping.gif?t=1749797420\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect items and points across different maps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078200/extras/collecting-glints.gif?t=1749797420\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Race against time or shadows of other players</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2078200/extras/race-against-time-or-bots.gif?t=1749797420\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Use jump pads and other power-ups for your advantage</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap